OL,3,GNEWSAWoman who killed abusive partner
OL,4,Aseeks application for retrial
OL,5,
OL,6,FProsecutors are seeking a retrial in
OL,7,Fthe case of a woman who stabbed her
OL,8,Fabusive partner to death.
OL,10,FJulie Ann McIlwaine was convicted of
OL,11,Fmurder in 2025 but had that conviction
OL,12,Foverturned on appeal earlier this
OL,13,Fmonth.
OL,15,FA defence barrister for McIlwaine said
OL,16,Fthe court of appeal should consider
OL,17,Fsubstituting a verdict.
OL,19,FMcIlwaine had admitted killing her
OL,20,Fpartner but denied murder, claiming to
OL,21,Fhave suffered a temporary loss of
OL,22,Fcontrol as a victim of domestic abuse.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
